{"acceptedOrdinal":2797,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457031196677","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_3_3_0ad1bff","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_3_3"],"source":"Miner: Ну? Чего ждёшь? Мы ведь для этого здесь.","sourceSha256":"c8341c6649c275c8266772850415d2a8a6f2fb3f363a6dd1a7172f8854801441","target":"Miner: Ano? Ano pang hinihintay mo? Iyan ang dahilan kaya narito tayo.","targetSha256":"ea2f9ddd06d3b528cdc5b1f4af310d311bf7c0be4992ccfe83ac383c0f661292","consumerIdentity":{"compiledProgramSha256":"33de1e80e55e4eb8ec2093078028aa83fc45ac8b77acc05c5a4f9477ebe92827","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_3_3_0ad1bff","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_3_3"],"sites":[{"node":"Miner_Entrance_3_3","instruction":5,"opcode":"RunLine","operands":["line:Miner_Entrance_3_3_0ad1bff",0.0]}]},"consumerIdentitySha256":"514eca7210ad5d99c3b183c56cf1856414811b8ec0ce453518686564d24fcd21","components":["explicitContext","glossaryReferent","localizedWording","runtimeBinding","mandatoryRegression"],"deltaReason":["currentMinusApplicablePrior","newClosure"],"reviewer":"/root/fil_independent_review_07","decision":"accepted-independent-reviewed-unit","findingId":null,"evidenceMode":"fresh-full-source-current-target-and-actual-context-read","reason":"The shared purpose is the present Miner/player exchange: preceding actual line says the player will descend and Miner will cover him from above. Inclusive tayo here preserves their proposed cooperation; it does not include the player in the earlier digging group.","authorIndependentCredit":0}
{"acceptedOrdinal":2798,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457031196676","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_3_3_052dcf1","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_3_3"],"source":"Miner: Ты ведь не из тех, кто всю жизнь будет ломать голову, думая: «А что, если бы я тогда не испугался?»","sourceSha256":"42cf3050b1f5d04ae6004e42a7575413332078dce4dfe2f88761d28a5bfbcf43","target":"Miner: Hindi ka naman siguro isa sa mga taong habambuhay mag-iisip ng: “Paano kung hindi ako natakot noon?”","targetSha256":"f7aeb5aaee4f32300af9cc52ce0d8a743dca2f6a27712b592de1946684025a83","consumerIdentity":{"compiledProgramSha256":"33de1e80e55e4eb8ec2093078028aa83fc45ac8b77acc05c5a4f9477ebe92827","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_3_3_052dcf1","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_3_3"],"sites":[{"node":"Miner_Entrance_3_3","instruction":4,"opcode":"RunLine","operands":["line:Miner_Entrance_3_3_052dcf1",0.0]}]},"consumerIdentitySha256":"3e683fd9d7573bd668c742845a50e20b421765ba581d17a75e07e5316c3198c0","components":["explicitContext","runtimeBinding","mandatoryRegression"],"deltaReason":["explicitlyInvalidated"],"reviewer":"/root/fil_independent_review_07","decision":"accepted-independent-reviewed-unit","findingId":null,"evidenceMode":"fresh-full-source-current-target-and-actual-context-read","reason":"Lifetime regret and quoted counterfactual about not having been afraid retained; rhetorical persuasion does not state a completed descent.","authorIndependentCredit":0}
{"acceptedOrdinal":2799,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457031196675","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_3_3_0019be1","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_3_3"],"source":"Miner: Давай, смелее. Ты спустишься, а я тут, наверху, за тебя отвечу.","sourceSha256":"3762da54c5346631019909884d9cb872c0099f899c461eb1b0d6ce732eb8c344","target":"Miner: Sige, lakasan mo ang loob mo. Bababa ka, at ako rito sa itaas ang bahala sa iyo.","targetSha256":"b17fe7579ecdf21f03f5d2f71533c769a3b409aa59619907cd8842c3f7d0255b","consumerIdentity":{"compiledProgramSha256":"33de1e80e55e4eb8ec2093078028aa83fc45ac8b77acc05c5a4f9477ebe92827","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_3_3_0019be1","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_3_3"],"sites":[{"node":"Miner_Entrance_3_3","instruction":3,"opcode":"RunLine","operands":["line:Miner_Entrance_3_3_0019be1",0.0]}]},"consumerIdentitySha256":"5070c699e35b6d497e820bfdeac5e8e67c7b1eff116d0c812c25d9d9a44883ef","components":["explicitContext","runtimeBinding","mandatoryRegression"],"deltaReason":["explicitlyInvalidated"],"reviewer":"/root/fil_independent_review_07","decision":"accepted-independent-reviewed-unit","findingId":null,"evidenceMode":"fresh-full-source-current-target-and-actual-context-read","reason":"Player descends; Miner stays above and promises to cover him. Bahala sa iyo retains the promise without inventing a guaranteed safe result.","authorIndependentCredit":0}
{"acceptedOrdinal":2804,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457027002378","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_3_2_0ae51c4","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_3_2"],"source":"Почему ты сам туда не полезешь?","sourceSha256":"d29e9cef40b0bbaa2b0d2eaf28ad429fb1af6f1612e82e7aee78d5346b06a527","target":"Bakit hindi ikaw mismo ang bumaba roon?","targetSha256":"bfbb5144044e892685a36c32fb597e79b385119006ab89710d35512441711569","consumerIdentity":{"compiledProgramSha256":"33de1e80e55e4eb8ec2093078028aa83fc45ac8b77acc05c5a4f9477ebe92827","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_3_2_0ae51c4","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_3_2"],"sites":[{"node":"Miner_Entrance_3_2","instruction":2,"opcode":"AddOption","operands":["line:Miner_Entrance_3_2_0ae51c4","L2256shortcutoption_Miner_Entrance_3_2_1",0.0,false]}]},"consumerIdentitySha256":"27e76e9c7ed579eb678759f744cee6298d21953590ca8f9ef4fe7c94c56dfb65","components":["explicitContext","runtimeBinding"],"deltaReason":["currentMinusApplicablePrior","newClosure"],"reviewer":"/root/fil_independent_review_07","decision":"accepted-independent-reviewed-unit","findingId":null,"evidenceMode":"fresh-full-source-current-target-and-actual-context-read","reason":"Player asks why Miner himself will not descend; action direction and interlocutor retained.","authorIndependentCredit":0}
{"acceptedOrdinal":2805,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457027002377","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_3_2_09f7a0b","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_3_2"],"source":"Miner: Ты чувствуешь? Это место, эта дыра – она тебя зовёт. Ты ведь это чувствуешь?","sourceSha256":"0ae49a0c12d7d357ff01a74c73ffc111bcc8b5ce43e610ccf289f5fbb0224a3c","target":"Miner: Nararamdaman mo ba? Ang lugar na ito, ang butas na ito—tinatawag ka nito. Nararamdaman mo rin, hindi ba?","targetSha256":"5503901b6e8852be77fb8b97937c1e563d9ea9d8950aa159c4ccf94f28da57e1","consumerIdentity":{"compiledProgramSha256":"33de1e80e55e4eb8ec2093078028aa83fc45ac8b77acc05c5a4f9477ebe92827","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_3_2_09f7a0b","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_3_2"],"sites":[{"node":"Miner_Entrance_3_2","instruction":1,"opcode":"RunLine","operands":["line:Miner_Entrance_3_2_09f7a0b",0.0]}]},"consumerIdentitySha256":"06c35a30a3fbcbbe815fe7eeee9e4f37f44fa9b052118d76fb3c7310e1dad790","components":["explicitContext","runtimeBinding","mandatoryRegression"],"deltaReason":["explicitlyInvalidated"],"reviewer":"/root/fil_independent_review_07","decision":"accepted-independent-reviewed-unit","findingId":null,"evidenceMode":"fresh-full-source-current-target-and-actual-context-read","reason":"Place/hole calls to the player, followed by repeated question about feeling it; source ambiguity retained.","authorIndependentCredit":0}
{"acceptedOrdinal":2806,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457027002376","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_3_2_0a11e84","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_3_2"],"source":"Miner: Какой другой? Я уже давно понял, что кто-то из нас должен действовать. Тут ведь не вечность – либо сейчас, либо никогда.","sourceSha256":"6a19d06d48864c6cd28df81d9a75a957a61f9a6c5967c562da8c0d4c769c7ba6","target":"Miner: Sinong isa pa? Matagal ko nang naunawaang may isa sa atin na kailangang kumilos. Wala tayong habang-panahon—ngayon na o hindi na kailanman.","targetSha256":"ef2b0da77e1ba51b8fa211a71b40e4178aace91f557f2553c228454e8e0eae58","consumerIdentity":{"compiledProgramSha256":"33de1e80e55e4eb8ec2093078028aa83fc45ac8b77acc05c5a4f9477ebe92827","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_3_2_0a11e84","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_3_2"],"sites":[{"node":"Miner_Entrance_3_2","instruction":0,"opcode":"RunLine","operands":["line:Miner_Entrance_3_2_0a11e84",0.0]}]},"consumerIdentitySha256":"74a652188e6b563d247cffe8274f6db630ad93cd2e254b0bce5780e805402685","components":["explicitContext","glossaryReferent","runtimeBinding","mandatoryRegression"],"deltaReason":["explicitlyInvalidated"],"reviewer":"/root/fil_independent_review_07","decision":"accepted-independent-reviewed-unit","findingId":null,"evidenceMode":"fresh-full-source-current-target-and-actual-context-read","reason":"Someone among the present interlocutors must act, with urgency now-or-never. Inclusive atin/tayong refers to proposed action in this exchange and is justified by the options and next actual branch.","authorIndependentCredit":0}
{"acceptedOrdinal":2821,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457022808070","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_3_046e909","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_3"],"source":"Miner: Не то чтобы я боюсь, но оно… ну… затягивает. Заглянуть бы ещё разочек, да поближе.","sourceSha256":"414254b05348b14b27bb971b456c0c362f1fa47e8e775e3806064e64c5b75c24","target":"Miner: Hindi naman sa natatakot ako, pero ito… eh… hinihigop ka. Gusto ko pang sumilip minsan, nang mas malapit.","targetSha256":"1acd23be0ab8c0ec0853c1f869163c767e3b00f3559b5e8b67a0bfdc2295a840","consumerIdentity":{"compiledProgramSha256":"33de1e80e55e4eb8ec2093078028aa83fc45ac8b77acc05c5a4f9477ebe92827","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_3_046e909","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_3"],"sites":[{"node":"Miner_Entrance_2_3","instruction":4,"opcode":"RunLine","operands":["line:Miner_Entrance_2_3_046e909",0.0]}]},"consumerIdentitySha256":"299ea971bf045c3b48f65815396ec7e41b77a85d88a84ca38e6d572a7d6d225c","components":["explicitContext","runtimeBinding"],"deltaReason":["currentMinusApplicablePrior","newClosure"],"reviewer":"/root/fil_independent_review_07","decision":"accepted-independent-reviewed-unit","findingId":null,"evidenceMode":"fresh-full-source-current-target-and-actual-context-read","reason":"Denial of simple fear, enticing/pulling effect, and wish for one closer look retained; metaphorical hinihigop ka preserves the attraction rather than declaring a completed physical event.","authorIndependentCredit":0}
{"acceptedOrdinal":2822,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457022808069","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_3_0d14661","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_3"],"source":"Miner: Но знаешь, иногда как встанешь рядом, и кажется, будто что-то зовёт. Прямо вот… зовёт. Попробуй, подойди. Прислушайся…","sourceSha256":"f8b599c6d800b73a6fdcc5f7ab84a3febee24986d6f77681f5da6238f86977d5","target":"Miner: Pero alam mo, kung minsan kapag tumayo ka rito, parang may tumatawag. Talagang… tumatawag. Subukan mong lumapit. Makinig ka…","targetSha256":"c1f6bfbcb806f2f200dc7a90140cf7f4d445ec227c467be8a942da7db3d24142","consumerIdentity":{"compiledProgramSha256":"33de1e80e55e4eb8ec2093078028aa83fc45ac8b77acc05c5a4f9477ebe92827","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_3_0d14661","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_3"],"sites":[{"node":"Miner_Entrance_2_3","instruction":3,"opcode":"RunLine","operands":["line:Miner_Entrance_2_3_0d14661",0.0]}]},"consumerIdentitySha256":"1d0047d1a278f7ab0067419c660b468a4027ffd2b7c6a64badb73eb09c7e5556","components":["explicitContext","runtimeBinding"],"deltaReason":["currentMinusApplicablePrior","newClosure"],"reviewer":"/root/fil_independent_review_07","decision":"accepted-independent-reviewed-unit","findingId":null,"evidenceMode":"fresh-full-source-current-target-and-actual-context-read","reason":"Standing near it seems to summon someone, repeated calling, approach and listening instructions all retained.","authorIndependentCredit":0}
{"acceptedOrdinal":2823,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457022808068","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_3_07c2ffe","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_3"],"source":"Miner: Ну а так, подходил, смотрел, когда мы все тут были… там темень такая, будто глаза закрываешь, и ничего-ничего.","sourceSha256":"e4e004f1fcedff4c431eb71c2304738de1d9883898b31e5404a86d3930edbd71","target":"Miner: Buweno, lumapit ako at sumilip noong narito kaming lahat… sobrang dilim sa loob, parang nakapikit ka at wala kang makita.","targetSha256":"0bdfd2f58caf0259df21430f5533c602534b214396b760b841743a845fb5e3b2","consumerIdentity":{"compiledProgramSha256":"33de1e80e55e4eb8ec2093078028aa83fc45ac8b77acc05c5a4f9477ebe92827","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_3_07c2ffe","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_3"],"sites":[{"node":"Miner_Entrance_2_3","instruction":2,"opcode":"RunLine","operands":["line:Miner_Entrance_2_3_07c2ffe",0.0]}]},"consumerIdentitySha256":"211e93d17f620571857cec39ca4b5c4b1584ee630799b89d91174067fc7ebfe1","components":["explicitContext","glossaryReferent","runtimeBinding","mandatoryRegression"],"deltaReason":["currentMinusApplicablePrior","newClosure"],"reviewer":"/root/fil_independent_review_07","decision":"accepted-independent-reviewed-unit","findingId":null,"evidenceMode":"fresh-full-source-current-target-and-actual-context-read","reason":"Earlier observation with his group uses exclusive kaming lahat; darkness and inability to see retained.","authorIndependentCredit":0}
{"acceptedOrdinal":2824,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457022808067","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_3_00e9a84","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_3"],"source":"Miner: Я бы рад был, но ты видишь, как тут всё: дёрнешь лишний раз верёвку – и всё, привет!","sourceSha256":"1c7fe52ec0100db11614c3341e0395eb0f136f4f0f24b614b60d98280294b8d3","target":"Miner: Gusto ko sana, pero nakikita mo naman ang kalagayan dito: isang maling hila sa lubid at tapos na!","targetSha256":"67d911d449f4f29b3aa643e9a78dee55a2291090e26f9c949c3a28a49d058a36","consumerIdentity":{"compiledProgramSha256":"33de1e80e55e4eb8ec2093078028aa83fc45ac8b77acc05c5a4f9477ebe92827","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_3_00e9a84","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_3"],"sites":[{"node":"Miner_Entrance_2_3","instruction":1,"opcode":"RunLine","operands":["line:Miner_Entrance_2_3_00e9a84",0.0]}]},"consumerIdentitySha256":"fb825cffefa1b16a4ca3f7cd81548a5913ab82564e5758d6030edf31760b0bfe","components":["explicitContext","runtimeBinding"],"deltaReason":["currentMinusApplicablePrior","newClosure"],"reviewer":"/root/fil_independent_review_07","decision":"accepted-independent-reviewed-unit","findingId":null,"evidenceMode":"fresh-full-source-current-target-and-actual-context-read","reason":"Wish to look and precarious rope consequence remain hypothetical; a wrong/extra pull ends badly without a specific invented casualty.","authorIndependentCredit":0}
{"acceptedOrdinal":2825,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457022808066","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_3_03fef22","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_3"],"source":"Miner: Да как заглядывал, так и не заглядывал!","sourceSha256":"93f2d312e57a0f4fcb0460ec1392d3476310e39de2e7673935359af24c7931b9","target":"Miner: Sumilip ba ako? Oo at hindi!","targetSha256":"505d7604776da10e55cfea43ae0b9cf7d5b3ef045d682db304fddb00bc9a37b7","consumerIdentity":{"compiledProgramSha256":"33de1e80e55e4eb8ec2093078028aa83fc45ac8b77acc05c5a4f9477ebe92827","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_3_03fef22","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_3"],"sites":[{"node":"Miner_Entrance_2_3","instruction":0,"opcode":"RunLine","operands":["line:Miner_Entrance_2_3_03fef22",0.0]}]},"consumerIdentitySha256":"bf67d9c6e877c60ff89dd6dc071d42902a9d2e51826da998318aa85f0018be1c","components":["explicitContext","runtimeBinding"],"deltaReason":["currentMinusApplicablePrior","newClosure"],"reviewer":"/root/fil_independent_review_07","decision":"accepted-independent-reviewed-unit","findingId":null,"evidenceMode":"fresh-full-source-current-target-and-actual-context-read","reason":"Contradictory yes-and-no answer to having looked retained; continuation explains its qualification.","authorIndependentCredit":0}
{"acceptedOrdinal":2832,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457018613767","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_1_0271afe","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_1"],"source":"Ты сам хоть заглядывал в дыру?","sourceSha256":"d77a97dd80e42c8963a71189fefbf009be2d511824480321b1ad0bca53cfaa9e","target":"Ikaw mismo, sumilip ka na ba sa butas?","targetSha256":"e6a192745dd9fb629208c510ad41e3677014fc894c364c4189e34817fae083f5","consumerIdentity":{"compiledProgramSha256":"33de1e80e55e4eb8ec2093078028aa83fc45ac8b77acc05c5a4f9477ebe92827","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_1_0271afe","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_1"],"sites":[{"node":"Miner_Entrance_2_1","instruction":3,"opcode":"AddOption","operands":["line:Miner_Entrance_2_1_0271afe","L2238shortcutoption_Miner_Entrance_2_1_1",0.0,false]}]},"consumerIdentitySha256":"c1aac62e9424d9ec15b652def9996a2b2b97a3820c34ed6887df778e21555ec8","components":["explicitContext","runtimeBinding"],"deltaReason":["explicitlyInvalidated"],"reviewer":"/root/fil_independent_review_07","decision":"accepted-independent-reviewed-unit","findingId":null,"evidenceMode":"fresh-full-source-current-target-and-actual-context-read","reason":"Player asks whether Miner himself has looked into the hole; subject and completed-experience question retained.","authorIndependentCredit":0}
{"acceptedOrdinal":2833,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457018613766","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_1_04422c2","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_1"],"source":"Miner: Ты хоть поешь там, наверху, а то, глядишь, сам скоро, как я, с фонарём засядешь. А жратвы-то здесь нет нифига.","sourceSha256":"997fec7190f3121241385037df7ac8e2cbf45071ee57b675ad9e4c90648d4e6c","target":"Miner: Kumain ka rin diyan sa itaas, baka maya-maya ay maupo ka na ring tulad ko na may hawak na flashlight. Wala namang makain dito, putangina.","targetSha256":"9604b325553eb1ea3d23c25cec81f913221f447236888bc5ccb68a1e2db3e02e","consumerIdentity":{"compiledProgramSha256":"33de1e80e55e4eb8ec2093078028aa83fc45ac8b77acc05c5a4f9477ebe92827","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_1_04422c2","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_1"],"sites":[{"node":"Miner_Entrance_2_1","instruction":2,"opcode":"RunLine","operands":["line:Miner_Entrance_2_1_04422c2",0.0]}]},"consumerIdentitySha256":"472676e5dc945e540aba689719a924b5b25cc25dc6a1f32673ba48e026b78fee","components":["explicitContext","localizedWording","runtimeBinding"],"deltaReason":["explicitlyInvalidated"],"reviewer":"/root/fil_independent_review_07","decision":"accepted-independent-reviewed-unit","findingId":null,"evidenceMode":"fresh-full-source-current-target-and-actual-context-read","reason":"Player is addressed upstairs, warned he could end up like Miner with a flashlight; lack of food below retained. Accepted rough register preserved.","authorIndependentCredit":0}
{"acceptedOrdinal":2834,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457018613765","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_1_0f64797","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_1"],"source":"Miner: Слушай, время тут вообще как-то странно идёт. Тут ни солнца, ни часов нет. Так что хрен знает, сколько мы тут уже.","sourceSha256":"d67d50a0f7773bca46d3b4ae5b0b0e331fcadea2b54deed90f4c8978694c4b8f","target":"Miner: Makinig ka, kakaiba ang daloy ng oras dito. Walang araw o orasan. Kaya malay natin kung gaano na kami katagal dito.","targetSha256":"61db8b1dc86b61d22653e20719d49dccfcffd44afc9b61ab00d4dbcab4ddec13","consumerIdentity":{"compiledProgramSha256":"33de1e80e55e4eb8ec2093078028aa83fc45ac8b77acc05c5a4f9477ebe92827","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_1_0f64797","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_1"],"sites":[{"node":"Miner_Entrance_2_1","instruction":1,"opcode":"RunLine","operands":["line:Miner_Entrance_2_1_0f64797",0.0]}]},"consumerIdentitySha256":"36462cc8efbc540c59fcb1cd3b6ef86119c7ad316529639ad7d4b4c5cc98b841","components":["changed","explicitContext","exactSourceRepetition","glossaryReferent","localizedWording","runtimeBinding","mandatoryRegression"],"deltaReason":["corrected","currentMinusApplicablePrior"],"reviewer":"/root/fil_independent_review_07","decision":"accepted-independent-reviewed-unit","findingId":null,"evidenceMode":"fresh-full-source-current-target-and-actual-context-read","reason":"Corrected kami explicitly excludes upstairs player from elapsed underground stay. Strange passage of time, absent sun/clocks and colloquial uncertainty all remain; malay natin scopes uncertainty without changing the exclusive group.","authorIndependentCredit":0}
{"acceptedOrdinal":2835,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457018613764","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_1_0313dcf","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_1"],"source":"Miner: Чего? Не слышу, громче говори! Сижу, да. Вторые сутки, может, третий день.","sourceSha256":"2bd6f8c448294610765ebaee49f7d68b640a20efd9f4b83f19fc86e5c6aecd0e","target":"Miner: Ano? Hindi ko marinig, lakasan mo! Nakaupo ako rito, oo. Ikalawang araw na siguro, o ikatlo.","targetSha256":"9560b6e489a98caa615f1e3b789f1c87ff909c50d884e4e45d7bdf2f12ac69bb","consumerIdentity":{"compiledProgramSha256":"33de1e80e55e4eb8ec2093078028aa83fc45ac8b77acc05c5a4f9477ebe92827","key":"line:Miner_Entrance_2_1_0313dcf","nodeNames":["Miner_Entrance_2_1"],"sites":[{"node":"Miner_Entrance_2_1","instruction":0,"opcode":"RunLine","operands":["line:Miner_Entrance_2_1_0313dcf",0.0]}]},"consumerIdentitySha256":"97139b627d3af4ab17af16297b3464ea614b06165d42a2bd4f87e0582e9b80c6","components":["explicitContext","runtimeBinding"],"deltaReason":["explicitlyInvalidated"],"reviewer":"/root/fil_independent_review_07","decision":"accepted-independent-reviewed-unit","findingId":null,"evidenceMode":"fresh-full-source-current-target-and-actual-context-read","reason":"Hard-of-hearing request to speak louder, sitting there and uncertain second/third day retained.","authorIndependentCredit":0}
